Data Pipeline

The platform includes automated refresh capabilities through an incremental pipeline.

Pipeline steps:

Generation data update
Load data update
Price data update
Imbalance calculation
Generation feature engineering
Market feature engineering
Risk feature engineering
Machine learning forecasting

The refresh process can be executed through:

python src/pipeline/refresh_pipeline.py
Data Sources

Primary source:

ENTSO-E Transparency Platform

The project uses European electricity market data including:

Actual electricity load
Forecast electricity load
Electricity generation by technology
Renewable generation
Electricity prices
Balancing market deviations
Feature Engineering

The platform creates market-relevant features including:

Load Features
Load forecast error
Lagged demand variables
Hourly patterns
Weekly seasonality
Monthly seasonality
Renewable Features
Renewable generation
Renewable penetration
Renewable volatility
Lagged renewable generation
Rolling statistics
Balancing Features
Imbalance magnitude
Imbalance direction
Imbalance cost proxy
Market stress indicators
Price Features
Electricity price
High price events
Price volatility indicators
Forecasting Models
Next-Day Forecasting

The platform includes machine learning forecasting models for short-term electricity market prediction.

Forecast targets:

Electricity demand
Balancing imbalance

Models implemented:

Linear Regression
Random Forest
XGBoost

Evaluation metrics:

MAE
RMSE
MAPE
Risk Intelligence Module

The platform evaluates three main categories of market risk.

Balancing Risk

Measures exposure related to electricity system deviations.

Key drivers:

Imbalance volatility
Forecast errors
System uncertainty
Price Risk

Analyzes electricity price uncertainty through:

Price volatility
Extreme price events
Market stress conditions
Renewable Risk

Evaluates renewable generation uncertainty through:

Renewable penetration
Generation variability
Forecast uncertainty
Interactive Dashboard

The project includes a Streamlit-based analytics dashboard.

Features:

Market Overview
Average electricity price
Imbalance volatility
Renewable exposure
Market stress indicators
Market Analytics
Price evolution
Balancing imbalance trends
Renewable generation mix
Risk Rankings

Cross-country comparison of:

Balancing risk
Price risk
Renewable risk
Forecast Performance

Model comparison through:

MAE
RMSE
Forecasting accuracy metrics

Run dashboard:

streamlit run src/dashboard/app.py
